    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your ex cheated with some athlete? Don\u2019t know what to do? It\u2019s time to go on a date! You meet Lily on the Internet, and she is eager to go to dinner with you. There's just one catch \u2014 she's Vegan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Just Date Vegan</strong> is a new game about real dates. Just as before, only you can decide how successful it will be. New jokes, a lot of different activities, and passionate endings are waiting for you. Now it will be harder to fail the date, but remember, it will take time to watch all the endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf3f Chat online</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf40 Share jokes and stories</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd22 Choose your meals</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc9a Put the moves on a girl</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd52 Enjoy the endings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lily is an incredible girl with many virtues. She likes animals and probably has a secret related to it. Can you unravel her mystery and unlock the special ending?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032190/extras/429361ef3bbfd76a15d46207bf321cce.poster.avif?t=1750932022\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032190/extras/429361ef3bbfd76a15d46207bf321cce.webm?t=1750932022\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032190/extras/429361ef3bbfd76a15d46207bf321cce.mp4?t=1750932022\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has multiple endings, and not all of them are positive. You'll have the opportunity to play it several times through different paths.</p>",
